{"id":"wb-6-581","name":"圣寿宝塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"圣寿宝塔","text":"圣寿宝塔，又名三峰寺塔，位于中华人民共和国福建省福州市长乐区境内的塔坪山上，是一座石制仿木楼阁式佛塔。该塔始建于1096年，于1117年建成。该塔通高27.4米，共有7层，平面呈八角形，由塔基、塔身和塔刹三部分组成。2006年，圣寿宝塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BF%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86557874,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86557874","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b69f085e0f1c1813b58b154f.jpg","title":"三峰寺塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%89%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/%E4%B8%89%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​三峰寺塔近景照","width":320,"height":432}}